(334, 200, 'invoice', 'Web Designing (CMS)', '<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Website Will be in English & Arabic</li>\r\n<li>Website will be User friendly for further assistance site map will be there too.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Menu<br /> Menu will be shown in categories & sub categories. The detail page of menu will contain its description with images. Related menu items will be shown too. </li>\r\n<li>Member’s Login<br /> User will register on website to complete the shopping process or he can continue as a guest.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Shopping Cart</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>User can add items using shopping cart which gives him complete information of items & there price. Also assisting for the checkout.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Payment Gateway<br /> The payment method will be Cash On Delivery. </li>\r\n<li>Monthly Plan<br /> Member can subscribe to a monthly plan. He have to order for the whole week in advance. After he select his weekly meals notification will send to both member & admin through emails.</li>\r\n<li>Newsletter Subscription<br /> User can subscribe to newsletter through which he can receive latest promotions or offers from admin.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Contact Us With Feedback Form Plus Google Location Map.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>News & Updates<br /> special offers or any promotion will be displayed in this section to keep user up to date.</li>\r\n<li>Link with Face book, Twitter & other social media sites.</li>\r\n<li>Social Media icons to make it fast and easy for the users to share any page to the social media websites.</li>\r\n<li>SEO Meta Tags<br /> Separate Meta tags for each page to help in SEO.</li>\r\n<li></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 1.00, 9000.00, NULL, NULL, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '', 0, NULL, NULL, 23, '', 0, 'N', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', ''),
