(2592, 1639, 'invoice', 'Custom Services', '<p><strong>Change in Work Flow of Booking along with Design Changes: 18 Hours</strong></p><br />\r\n<p><strong>Item 20: Freezing Panel: 4 hours</strong></p><br />\r\n<p>-When the member access the freezing panel. First thing to show him that the </p><br />\r\n<p>-Freezing Days Remaining: 45 (example) then </p><br />\r\n<p>-I would like to freeze my membership <g class=\"gr_ gr_18 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Punctuation only-del replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"18\" data-gr-id=\"18\">for:</g> 20 days ( Example, it would be a  number drop down from 1 to the remaining number of freezing days. </p><br />\r\n<p>-Starting from: choose a date from a calendar. </p><br />\r\n<p>-On the dashboard of the member, under the Renewal <g class=\"gr_ gr_19 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Punctuation only-ins replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"19\" data-gr-id=\"19\">date</g> it would show him at all times Freezing Days Remaining: 45 (example). If he clicked on the word freeze it would take him to the freezing panel.</p>', 22.00, 200.00, 'Hours', 1, '1970-01-01', '1970-01-01', '', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', ''),
