(2651, 19, 'proposal', 'Social Media Maintenance', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Facebook & Instagram</strong>- We will develop and implement marketing strategies for your business\'s social media channels- We build and execute social media strategy through competitive research, messaging and audience identification- Generate, edit, publish and share content (original text, images, video or html) that builds meaningful connections and encourage followers to keep following- Set up and optimize company pages within each platform to increase the visibility of company’s social content- Create editorial calendars and syndication schedules- Continuously improve social media experience by capturing and analyzing the appropriate social data/metrics, insights and best practices, and then acting on the information- Article writing, creating social media profiles, managing regular posts and responding to followers</span></p><br />\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>We</strong>- Discover optimal times to post- Examine the right keywords & # tags for posting- Research your competition- Identify industry influencers- Find relevant followers & target audience- Use applications to post scheduling- Only work on goal-integrated platforms- Build customer loyalty with social media- Complement social media by thinking locally- Create paid marketing campaigns to maximize the reach</span></p><br />\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>You</strong>- Will get more audience, fans & followers on social media pages- Will receive customer reviews about your service- Will get best recruitment experience through social media- Identify best people during targeting- Can cultivate stronger relationships with your audience- Can have live events posting or events scheduling- Can share news & announcements to mass audience- Can serve your clients with social business integration- Can share viral videos with your fans to leave a long lasting effect on their mind- Can provide best customer service with your social media</span></p>', 1.00, 1500.00, '', 1, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '0', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', ''),
(2655, 1672, 'invoice', 'Web Portal', 'General Features:-Fully Responsive, with Mobile First Presentation-Technology: Code ignitor Framework with MYSQLAdmin Panel:-Define Users, and their authority to verify different forms/visitors-See the Audit Trial-Define Master/Constant Items-Add External Bodies and their Pre - approversUsers Panel:-User can Login, manage their Profile-User will see the list of pending verifications-Will Accept/Un AcceptVisitor Panel:-Visitor can signup and make profile-Visitor can also make sub visitors (For Example, Labour)-Visitors can fill up various Requests and get notified for approved/unapproved-Visitor can print the formsForms:-Visitor can signup and make profile-Visitor Registration Form-Sub Visitor Additions/Deletion Form-DC Access Request-Visitor can signup and make profile-Material Movement-Work PermitLists:-Users List-Visitors List with their Status (Approved, Pre-approved, etc)-Visitors Request and statusOptional:-Two - Factor Security System-Visitors can upload ID Docs-Auto Notification of Expiries for ID Docs-Offline Registration: Visitor can download required forms, fill up and submit manually. An Authorised user will enter this information into the system on behalf of the visitor.-Website (With All Features as Explained above)-with Bespoke Design', 1.00, 20000.00, '', 1, '1970-01-01', '1970-01-01', '', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', '1312911000000231665'),
(2652, 19, 'proposal', 'Search Engine Optimization (SEO) - Business Starter Package', '<p>- Upload 10 key indexable phrases that you choose to market your business. <br />\r\n- Analyze your competition. <br />\r\n- Examine the structure and content of your Website. <br />\r\n- Create and upload search-engine friendly meta data. <br />\r\n- Provide a comprehensive SEO analysis of your site. <br />\r\n- Deliver support to discuss the present and future of your Web site. <br />\r\n- Submit your site to up to different search engines and directories. <br />\r\n- Submission of Press Releases <br />\r\n- Submission of Articles to Web 2.0 Properties <br />\r\n- Google Site Map Creation & Submission <br />\r\n- Both IN-Page and Off-Page SEO <br />\r\n- Competitor Analysis, and Regular steps to increase PR of Site <br />\r\n- Monitor traffic using the latest SEO technology. <br />\r\n- Site Map Submissions to Google/Yahoo/MSN <br />\r\n- Robot.txt Optimization - Social Bookmarking <br />\r\n- Content Optimization</p><br />\r\n<p><strong>Monthly Web Audit</strong> <br />\r\n- Competition Analysis & Re-Adjustment of On-Page Optimization <br />\r\n- Keyword Ranking Report <br />\r\n- Link Analysis Report <br />\r\n- Web Traffic Report</p><br />\r\n<p>Min. 1 Year Contract</p>', 1.00, 1500.00, '', 2, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '0', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', ''),
