(2743, 42, 'proposal', 'Search Engine Optimization (SEO) - Business Starter Package', '<p>- Upload 10 key indexable phrases that you choose to market your business<br />- Analyze your competition<br />- Examine the structure and content of your Website&nbsp;<br />- Create and upload search-engine friendly meta data<br />- Provide a comprehensive SEO analysis of your site<br />- Deliver support to discuss the present and future of your Web site<br />- Submit your site to up to 100 search engines and directories. <br />- Submission of Press Releases <br />- Submission of Articles to Web 2.0 Properties <br />- Google &amp; Yahoo Site Maps Creation &amp; Submission <br />- Both IN-Page and Off-Page SEO <br />- Competitor Analysis, and Regular steps to increase PR of Site <br />- Monitor traffic using the latest SEO technology<br />- Site Map Submissions to Google<br />- Robot.txt Optimization <br />- Social Bookmarking <br />- Content Optimization</p><br />\r\n<p><strong>Monthly Web Audit</strong> <br /><br />- Competition Analysis &amp; Re-Adjustment of On-Page Optimization <br />- Keyword Ranking Report <br />- Link Analysis Report <br />- Web Traffic Report</p><br />\r\n<p>Min. 1 Year Contract</p>', 1.00, 2000.00, '', 1, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '0', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', ''),
