(3447, 180, 'proposal', 'GSuite Pro Edition', '<p class=\"usertext\">7-GSuit Professional Accounts<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIntelligent office suite <br />\r\n<br />\r\n30-GB Secure cloud-based file storage per user Access across devices (computer, phone, or tablet) <br />\r\n<br />\r\nUsage: G Suite can be used across iOS and Android devices with no limits on the number of devices you can use. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWorks without Internet connection View, edit, and create content on Gmail, Google Calendar, and Google Docs, even when you\'re not on the Internet. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour content will sync automatically when you reconnect. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCompatible with Microsoft Office View and transform Microsoft Word, PowerPoint, and Excel files into editable G Suite files directly from your web browser or mobile device. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCentralized administration console Administrators have one place to create new users, manage services, and secure devices. </p>', 6.00, 229.00, '', 1, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '0', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', ''),
