(4005, 277, 'proposal', 'Custom Web Development Service', '<p><strong><span>Auto Renewal:</span></strong></p><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>Include a legal statement such as:</li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<p><strong><span>Billing Cycle - </span></strong><span>the fee for your BBG membership, will be charged on an annual basis to your Payment Method on the calendar day corresponding to the commencement of your account. </span></p><br />\r\n<p><span>This should be included in the Terms & Conditions to inform them that the membership will automatically renew annually. </span></p><br />\r\n<ol start=\"2\"><br />\r\n<li>15 Days before renewal, the system will generate an email stating, “Your Membership is due for renewal on <strong>date needs to pull from the system</strong>. Please note that it will be renewed automatically, and membership fees will be charged on your card. In case, you want to change certain information on membership, please contact Lindsay Aitken on +971 4 397 0303</li><br />\r\n<li>In the case they don’t want to renew, they will call, and the BT will have an opportunity to convince them to remain members. Otherwise, the auto-renewal can be disabled. (only BT will have authority to disable auto-renewal)</li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<p><span>Note: Credit Card info will be stored with Payment Gateway.</span></p><br />\r\n<p><strong><span>Tax Invoice:</span></strong></p><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>Auto-generate a tax invoice from proforma Invoice on Payment</li><br />\r\n<li>Auto send to the client on successful payment</li><br />\r\n<li>Admin can see the list of tax invoices</li><br />\r\n<li>Admin will be able to re-send tax invoice</li><br />\r\n<li>Admin can export all invoices in excel format</li><br />\r\n<li>Search filters: admin can search by (invoice #, date, user, proforma invoice#, payment ref# )</li><br />\r\n<li>Download invoice as pdf</li><br />\r\n<li>Maintain a check if the receipt has been sent to the member on payment</li><br />\r\n<li>Save receipts to maintain a record</li><br />\r\n<li>Admin can resend receipt generated</li><br />\r\n<li>View/download receipt as pdf </li><br />\r\n</ol>', 1.00, 15000.00, '', 1, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '0', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', ''),
