(5558, 3160, 'invoice', 'New Website Design & Development', '<p>WordPress: Website Design & Development <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n Complete New 2020 Design will be made as per the E-Commerce requirement. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Your required color scheme or logo color will be used <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Your required or selected font will be used <br />\r\n<br />\r\n If you want to change the design even 100 times, we will do that for you without any extra charges but once the design is finalized then you cannot make major changes. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Minor changes can be accepted any time. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Content and pictures will be provided by Go To Somaliland <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Fully customizable CMS with highly flexible design that can provide requirement-oriented solution for the client’s needs <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Professional and appealing design that should represent the look and feel of the brand <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Design based on latest technology to meet the current industry trends <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Mobile-friendly and responsive design/mobile site that can perfectly load on iDevices, Tablets and all types of Smartphone and crossbrowser compatibility for better user experience <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Business oriented navigations and user-friendly design as per current marketing trends that help increasing the number of organic <br />\r\n<br />\r\n design concept layout for Homepage and the inner pages need to be send for approval <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n API’s will be integrated for Airlines and Hotels <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Basic SEO will be done. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Social Media Integration for marketing purposes <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Our development team takes good care of SEO standards so that your website can perform well in search engines <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n Live Chat option <br />\r\n<br />\r\n WhatsApp Icon <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Email Icon <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Powerful CMS with user-friendly layout that does not require special expertise or operator, only basic computer literacy is required to use our CMS</p>', 1.00, 3000.00, '', 1, '2020-08-29', '2020-11-30', '1', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', '1312911000002106095'),
