(1014, 620, 'invoice', 'Website Maintenance', '<p><strong>Website Maintenance Services (Additional Hours)</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Task List</strong></p>\r\n<p>&raquo; To add &ldquo;New Year&rsquo;s Greeting&rdquo; message on Home Page</p>\r\n<p>&raquo; To add &ldquo;Independence Day Celebration Invitation&rdquo; on &ldquo;News &amp; Happenings&rdquo; Page.</p>\r\n<p>&raquo; To remove last article from Home Page</p>\r\n<p>&raquo; To add images in &ldquo;Events Gallery&rdquo;.</p>\r\n<p><strong><br /></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Data Provided.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Total of 207 images were provided.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Task Duration</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Day 1 ( 5 hours)</strong></p>\r\n<p>Optimized first 96 images, with re-scaling according to web specs.</p>\r\n<p>Uploaded images to respective directories.</p>\r\n<p>Added 2 images on home page and news and happenings page.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Day 2 (5 hours)</strong></p>\r\n<p>Created article pages for first 7 directory folders.</p>\r\n<p>Linked 3 articles to gallery pages.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Day 3 ( 3 hours)</strong></p>\r\n<p>Optimized remaining 111 images for web with re-scaling.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Day 4 ( 3hours)</strong></p>\r\n<p>Created remaining 10 folders in image gallery and uploaded images</p>\r\n<p>Created 10 articles for each uploaded directory</p>\r\n<p><strong>Day 5 (3 hours)</strong></p>\r\n<p>Created 18 boxes in gallery page and linked with each articles and directory folders.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Total Hours: 19 Hours<br />Allowed Hours in a month: 3<br />Additional Hours: 16</strong></p>', 16.00, 120.00, NULL, NULL, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '', 0, NULL, NULL, 70, 'Monthly', 0, 'N', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', '');
