(2821, 65, 'proposal', 'Additional Scope of Work \r\nSAVING FILLED UP FORMS DATA', '<p>Forms will have a save button which will allow users to visit another page/FORM and when they comeback they can find the filled up data  what they had saved</p><br />\r\n<p>NOTE: 10-12 ADDITIONAL HOURS REQUIRE TO COMPLETE THIS JOB</p>', 1.00, 2000.00, '', 1, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '0', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', ''),
