(2710, 32, 'proposal', 'Website Maintenance', '<p><strong>Website Maintenance Services</strong></p><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Backup <g class=\"gr_ gr_301 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Style multiReplace\" id=\"301\" data-gr-id=\"301\">Frequency :</g>&nbsp;Monthly (Offline)</span></li><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">CMS Updates (As Available) : <g class=\"gr_ gr_366 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling ins-del multiReplace\" id=\"366\" data-gr-id=\"366\">Montly</g></span></li><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Backup is Maintained <g class=\"gr_ gr_364 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Punctuation only-del replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"364\" data-gr-id=\"364\"><g class=\"gr_ gr_411 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling ins-del multiReplace\" id=\"411\" data-gr-id=\"411\">upto</g>:</g>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 3 Months</span></li><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Plugins Updates (As Available)</span></li><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Theme Updates whenever necessary with update in CMS</span></li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Design/Update Services:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;(1 Hour Monthly)</span></p><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">New Banners </span></li><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Product changes or additions</span></li><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Updates to calendar or upcoming events</span></li><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Post job opportunities</span></li><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Photos, graphics, graphs, and charts updated</span></li><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Text re-writes or edits</span></li><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Site facelifts and makeovers</span></li><br />\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">-Bugs Removal</spa