(2753, 1709, 'invoice', 'Custom Web Development Service', '<ul><br />\r\n<li>Members Renewal System</li><br />\r\n<li>Member History Showing Renewals/Cancellations etc</li><br />\r\n<li>Note on Member Profile Actions like on Hold, Cancellation</li><br />\r\n<li><br />\r\n<p><em> </em><strong>Item 19: Members panel  </strong><strong>(In Progress)</strong></p><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<li><strong>Once </strong><strong></strong><strong>a new member <g class=\"gr_ gr_270 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar multiReplace\" id=\"270\" data-gr-id=\"270\">is created</g> an automatic message to be sent to him from <g class=\"gr_ gr_258 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling ins-del multiReplace\" id=\"258\" data-gr-id=\"258\">md</g> email with the username and password. Template message attached. “ Email New”. In the future, the email will have a template video attached. </strong></li><br />\r\n<li><strong>Once the member <g class=\"gr_ gr_256 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar multiReplace\" id=\"256\" data-gr-id=\"256\">access</g> his account from the website or application, a change password is mandatory. </strong></li><br />\r\n<li>Member log to be available showing deleted booking history and <g class=\"gr_ gr_269 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling\" id=\"269\" data-gr-id=\"269\">active</g>. In addition, used <g class=\"gr_ gr_253 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling ins-del multiReplace\" id=\"253\" data-gr-id=\"253\">in house</g> captains EX 2/4 and used freezing dates 13/45. Once the members <g class=\"gr_ gr_267 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar multiReplace\" id=\"267\" data-gr-id=\"267\">renews</g> a new log would start and the old log will remain under active0. </li><br />\r\n<li>Once the member renews an automatic email will be sent, <g class=\"gr_ gr_257 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar only-ins doubleReplace replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"257\" data-gr-id=\"257\">password</g> will NOT be affected. Renewal email attached. </li><br />\r\n<li>Email listing for the member’s panel, say to filter as discussed. </li><br />\r\n<li><span>after the account is created, if any changes took place such as an extension or add a captain a remark box shall appear to fill the reason with <g class=\"gr_ gr_261 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar only-ins doubleReplace replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"261\" data-gr-id=\"261\">date stamp</g>. </span></li><br />\r\n<li><span>The Renewal date that is at the moment on top right <g class=\"gr_ gr_254 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling ins-del\" id=\"254\" data-gr-id=\"254\">conner</g> of the dashboard to be placed on top before the icons. And when the renewal period is within 45 <g class=\"gr_ gr_255 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling ins-del multiReplace\" id=\"255\" data-gr-id=\"255\">daysthe</g> <g class=\"gr_ gr_260 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar multiReplace\" id=\"260\" data-gr-id=\"260\">date</g> turn red and blinks.<strong> </strong></span></li><br />\r\n<li>If the member tried to log in after he expired, a message should appear that <g class=\"gr_ gr_280 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar multiReplace\" id=\"280\" data-gr-id=\"280\">say</g>, “ Dear Captain, your membership is expired, to Renew your membership please Email <a href=\"mailto:md@thecptainsclub.ae\">md@thecptainsclub.ae</a>” </li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n</li><br />\r\n</ul>', 40.00, 200.00, 'Hours', 1, '1970-01-01', '1970-01-01', '', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', ''),
(2754, 1710, 'invoice', 'Custom Web Development Service', '<p>Change of Booking History Layout</p><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<li>Adding Tabs and <g class=\"gr_ gr_31 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling ins-del multiReplace\" id=\"31\" data-gr-id=\"31\">filteration</g> for Active Booking, Deleted, Archived and Booking <g class=\"gr_ gr_75 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling ins-del multiReplace\" id=\"75\" data-gr-id=\"75\">Hostory</g></li><br />\r\n<li>Adding Tabs for Requests <g class=\"gr_ gr_143 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling ins-del multiReplace\" id=\"143\" data-gr-id=\"143\">Hostory</g>, Met, unmet, etc</li><br />\r\n</ul>', 8.00, 200.00, 'Hours', 1, '1970-01-01', '1970-01-01', '', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', ''),
