(3223, 144, 'proposal', 'Search Engine Optimization (SEO) - Business Starter Package', '<p>- Upload 20-25 key indexable phrases that you choose to market your business. - Analyze your competition. - Examine the structure and content of your Web site. - Create and upload search-engine friendly meta data. - Provide a comprehensive SEO analysis of your site. - Deliver support to discuss the present and future of your Web site. - Submit your site to up to 100 search engines and directories. - Submission of Press Releases - Submission of Articles to Web 2.0 Properties - Google Site Maps Creation & Submission - Both IN-Page and Off-Page SEO - Competitor Analysis, and Regular steps to increase PR of Site - Monitor traffic using the latest SEO technology. - Site Map Submissions to Google - Robot.txt Optimization - Social Bookmarking - Content Optimization</p><br />\r\n<p><strong>Monthly Web Audit</strong> - Competition Analysis & Re-Adjustment of On-Page Optimization - Keyword Ranking Report - Link Analysis Report - Web Traffic Report</p><br />\r\n<p>Min. 1 Year Contract</p>', 1.00, 2500.00, '', 1, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '0', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', ''),
