(4108, 294, 'proposal', 'Custom Web Development Service', '<strong>Customer Additional Expenses:</strong> <br><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>Additional Customer Expenses can be of 4 types. Fuel, In-house Captain, BBQ and Charges for Boat Maintenance</li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>A customer can Deposit Money through Credit Card or Manually (BY Cash, Check or Bank Transfer) - Credit Card Integration    </li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>Every time, Customer Uses any of the above services, OPerations Team will add these expenses. Which will be automatically Deducted from Customer Account.</li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>Elite Admin can have 3 types of Controls:</li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>Allow the user to have Negative Balance </li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>Dis-Allow user booking in case, his deposit money is not enough.</li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n</ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n</li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n</ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>In case Customer is not allowed booking for not having enough balance in Booking, he will not be allowed to book unless he deposits money.</li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n</ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>A customer can see his Ledger Report</li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n</ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<strong>Operation Manager:</strong> <br><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>Operation Manager will see all daily bookings on his Tablet.</li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>He will update all bookings, in case they<span xss=\"removed\"> are actually used or no show/attendance </span></li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li><span xss=\"removed\">After completion of Trip, he will update the system for </span>fuel<span xss=\"removed\"> used, </span>in-house<span xss=\"removed\"> Captain or BBQ. He will also update Boat Condition. </span></li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li><span xss=\"removed\">Customer will sign the Trip COmpletion Report. </span></li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n</ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<strong>Administration:</strong> <br><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>In case there is a Damage reported in \"Trip Completion Report\", the admin<span xss=\"removed\"> will add </span>an invoice<span xss=\"removed\"> to </span>the customer<span xss=\"removed\">. Which will be deducted from his deposited cash.</span></li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li><span xss=\"removed\">Admin can see all reports, including Deposits/Cash Accounting.</span></li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n</ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<strong>Reports:</strong><br><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<ul><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>User Can View His Ledger, Deposit and Spending Report</li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n<li>Admin Can View Accumulative or customer wise ledgers filtered by Date</li><br><br><br><br><br />\r\n</ul>', 1.00, 28000.00, '', 1, '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '0', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, '', 0, 'Y', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'other', ''),
