(19, 'ALHUMDULILLAH meeting fixed he will come to our place on Monday betwen 3 pm to 4 pm......call after 2 pm today if he will not call.........He said wahtsap me your num I will tell you about tomorrow meeting Hassan is the owner and I had a deep conversation regarding SEO and Google Adwords and I have quoted him 2000 for seo and 1500 for Ad words so in sha ALLAH eh will do it baki jo ALLAH PAK ko manzor', '2020-01-13 15:00:00', 1, 2000, 36, 'lead', 0, 36);
