i>\r\n<li>Optimised Display on All Phones</li>\r\n<li>Optimised Display on Tablet Devices</li>\r\n<li>Optimised User Experience</li>\r\n<li>Optimized Loading Speed for Smaller Devices</li>\r\n<li>Search Engine Optimised for Smaller Devices</li>\r\n<li>Manage the Same Code, Files and Administration for all Devices</li>\r\n<li>Linkage to Social Media Accounts</li>\r\n<li>Creation of Social Media Accounts / Basic ( facebook, LinkedIn, Instagram, twitter )</li>\r\n</ul>\";}', '1', 'Khuram Iqbal', '2017-12-04 14:43:14'),
