(1828, 'invoice', 1672, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_long_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:5919:\"<div role=\"listitem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><br />\r\n<div role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Naseem Aslam, General Features:  Fully Responsive, with Mobile First Presentation  Technology: Code ignitor Framework with MYSQL  Admin Panel:  Define Users, and their authority to verify different forms/visitors  See the Audit Trial  Define Master/Constant Items  Add External Bodies and their Pre-approvers Users Panel:  User can Login, manage their Profile  User will see the list of pending verifications  Will Accept/Un Accept Visitor Panel:  Visitor can signup and make profile  Visitor can also make sub visitors (For Example, Labour)  Visitors can fill up various Requests and get notified for approved/unapproved  Visitor can print the forms Forms:  Pre approvers addition Form  Visitor Registration Form  Sub Visitor Additions/Deletion Form   DC Access Request  Material Movement  Work Permit Lists:  Users List  Visitors List with their Status (Approved, Pre approved, etc)  Visitors Request and status Optional:  Two-Factor Security System  Visitors can upload ID Docs  Auto Notification of Expiries for ID Docs  Offline Registration: Visitor can download required forms, filup and submit manually.  An Authorised user will enter these information in system on behalf of visitor. , sent at 1:27 PM.\"><br />\r\n<div><br />\r\n<div><br />\r\n<div role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Naseem Aslam, General Features:  Fully Responsive, with Mobile First Presentation  Technology: Code ignitor Framework with MYSQL  Admin Panel:  Define Users, and their authority to verify different forms/visitors  See the Audit Trial  Define Master/Constant Items  Add External Bodies and their Pre-approvers Users Panel:  User can Login, manage their Profile  User will see the list of pending verifications  Will Accept/Un Accept Visitor Panel:  Visitor can