(4314, 'invoice', 2287, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_long_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:1519:\"<p class=\"usertext\"><span><strong>Custom Services</strong></span><br><span></span></p><br />\r\n<p class=\"usertext\">Video Making <br>- Training Session 10-20 people <br>- 1 to 6 hours per day <br>- Total number of days 29 <br>- Venue: Media One Hotel, Media City Dubai<span> <br><br></span><strong>The Video Development Process</strong></p><br />\r\n<p>Video Development Process Overview</p><br />\r\n<p><strong>Phase 1: Planning</strong></p><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>Coordinate and pre-produce locations and schedule shooting days.</li><br />\r\n<li>Create rough outline</li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<p><strong>Phase 2:  Production</strong></p><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>Film all scenarios</li><br />\r\n<li>This includes multiple activities during the different sessions with trainers and participants.</li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<p><strong>Phase 3:  Post-Production</strong></p><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>Complete edits of video for Client review.</li><br />\r\n<li>Incorporate client feedback. </li><br />\r\n<li>Video submit for client approval or changes.</li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<p class=\"usertext\"><strong>Phase 4: </strong><span></span></p><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>DVD Delivery to the client</li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<br><strong>Schedule</strong><span> </span><strong>Timeline of the Activity</strong><span></span><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>Restarted 9th December, 2018 till 3rd of January 2019. </li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<strong>Delivery:</strong><span></span><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>Files will be delivered on DVDs</li><br />\r\n</ol>\";i:1;s:1548:\"<p class=\"usertext\"><span><strong>Custom Services</strong></span><span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"usertext\">Video Making - Training Session 10-20 people - 1 to 6 hours per day - Total number of days 29 - Venue: Media One Hotel, Media City Dubai<span> </span><strong>The Video Development Process</strong></p>\r\n<p>Video Development Process Overview</p>\r\n<p><strong>Phase 1: Planning</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Coordinate and pre-produce locations and schedule shooting days.</li>\r\n<li>Create rough outline</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Phase 2:  Production</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Film all scenarios</li>\r\n<li>This includes multiple activities during the different sessions with trainers and participants.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Phase 3:  Post-Production</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Complete edits of video for Client review.</li>\r\n<li>Incorporate client feedback. </li>\r\n<li>Video submit for client approval or changes.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"usertext\"><strong>Phase 4: </strong><span></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>DVD Delivery to the client</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<strong>Schedule</strong><span> </span><strong>Timeline of the Activity</strong><span></span>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Restarted 9th December, 2018 till 3rd of January 2019. </li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<strong>Delivery:</strong><span></span>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Files will be delivered on DVDs</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<br><br>4th November to 8th November - 2018 (5 Days) Payment is made & Collected<br><br>This given invoice is for the following period<br>1. 9th December to 13th December - 2018 (5 Days)<br>2. 16th December to 20th December - 2018 (5 Days)\";}', '22', 'Faisal Ijaz', '2018-12-24 12:14:32'),
(4315, 'invoice', 2287, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_long_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:1734:\"<p class=\"usertext\"><span><strong>Custom Services</strong></span><span></span></p><br />\r\n<p class=\"usertext\">Video Making - Training Session 10-20 people - 1 to 6 hours per day - Total number of days 29 - Venue: Media One Hotel, Media City Dubai<span> </span><strong>The Video Development Process</strong></p><br />\r\n<p>Video Development Process Overview</p><br />\r\n<p><strong>Phase 1: Planning</strong></p><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>Coordinate and pre-produce locations and schedule shooting days.</li><br />\r\n<li>Create rough outline</li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<p><strong>Phase 2:  Production</strong></p><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>Film all scenarios</li><br />\r\n<li>This includes multiple activities during the different sessions with trainers and participants.</li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<p><strong>Phase 3:  Post-Production</strong></p><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>Complete edits of video for Client review.</li><br />\r\n<li>Incorporate client feedback. </li><br />\r\n<li>Video submit for client approval or changes.</li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<p class=\"usertext\"><strong>Phase 4: </strong><span></span></p><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>DVD Delivery to the client</li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<strong>Schedule</strong><span> </span><strong>Timeline of the Activity</strong><span></span><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>Restarted 9th December, 2018 till 3rd of January 2019. </li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<strong>Delivery:</strong><span></span><br />\r\n<ol><br />\r\n<li>Files will be delivered on DVDs</li><br />\r\n</ol><br />\r\n<br><br>4th November to 8th November - 2018 (5 Days) Payment is made & Collected<br><br>This given invoice is for the following period<br>1. 9th December to 13th December - 2018 (5 Days)<br>2. 16th December to 20th December - 2018 (5 Days)\";i:1;s:1540:\"<p class=\"usertext\"><span><strong>Custom Services</strong></span><span></span></p>\r\