(4653, 'invoice', 2348, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_long_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:1801:\"<p class=\"usertext\"><strong>Custom Services</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Video Making</strong> <br />\r\n- Training Session 10-20 people - 1 to 6 hours per day<br />\r\n- Total number of days 29 - Venue: Media One Hotel, Media City<br />\r\nDubai<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>The Video Development Process</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Video Development Process Overview<br />\r\n</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Phase 1: Planning</strong><br />\r\n1.Coordinate and pre-produce locations and schedule shooting<br />\r\ndays.<br />\r\n2.Create rough outline<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Phase 2: Production<br />\r\n</strong><br />\r\n1.Film all scenarios<br />\r\n2.This includes multiple activities during the different sessions<br />\r\nwith trainers and participants.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Phase 3: Post-Production<br />\r\n</strong><br />\r\n1.Complete edits of video for Client review.<br />\r\n2.Incorporate client feedback.<br />\r\n3.Video submit for client approval or changes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Phase 4:</strong><br />\r\n1.DVD Delivery to the client<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Schedule Timeline of the Activity<br />\r\n</strong><br />\r\n1.Restarted 9th December, 2018 till 3rd of January 2019.<br />\r\nDelivery:<br />\r\n2.Files will be delivered on DVDs<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nData is Delivered & Payment is Made for the following period.<br />\r\n1.4th November to 8th November - 2018 (5 Days)<br />\r\n2.9th December to 13th December - 2018 (5 Days<br />\r\n3.16th December to 20th December - 2018 (5 Days)<br />\r\n4.23rd December to 30th December - 2018 (5 Days)<br />\r\n5. 31st December 2018 to 3rd January -2019 (3 Days)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPayment is pending for the following:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1. 50 dirhams per day bonus (Invoice sent)<br />\r\n2. 20th January 2019 (Attached invoice)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHeadoffice Address: P.O.BOX 3223, DUBAI, UAE</p>\";i:1;s:1531:\"<p class=\"usertext\"><strong>Custom Services</strong> <strong>Video Making</strong> - Training Session 10-20 people - 1 to 6 hours per day - Total number of days 29 - Venue: Media One Hotel, Media City Dubai <strong>The Video Development Process</strong> <strong>Video Development Process Overview </strong> <strong>Phase 1: Planning</strong> 1.Coordinate and pre-produce locations and schedule shooting days. 2.Create rough outline <strong>Phase 2: Production </strong> 1.Film all scenarios 2.This includes multiple activities during the different sessions with trainers and participants. <strong>Phase 3: Post-Production </strong> 1.Complete edits of video for Client review. 2.Incorporate client feedback. 3.Video submit for client approval or changes. <strong>Phase 4:</strong> 1.DVD Delivery to the client <strong>Schedule Timeline of the Activity </strong> 1.Restarted 9th December, 2018 till 3rd of January 2019. Delivery: 2.Files will be delivered on DVDs Data is Delivered & Payment is Made for the following period. 1.4th November to 8th November - 2018 (5 Days) 2.9th December to 13th December - 2018 (5 Days 3.16th December to 20th December - 2018 (5 Days) 4.23rd December to 30th December - 2018 (5 Days) 5. 31st December 2018 to 3rd January -2019 (3 Days) Payment is pending for the following: 1. 50 dirhams per day bonus (Invoice sent) 2. 20th January 2019 (Attached invoice) Headoffice Address: P.O.BOX 3223, DUBAI, UAE</p>\r\n<p class=\"usertext\">\'This given invoice is for the period of 10th January 2019\'<br><br></p>\";}', '22', 'Faisal Ijaz', '2019-02-13 10:42:22');
