(5010, 'invoice', 2438, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_long_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:889:\"<p>Google Adwords Campaign Management <span><strong>Google Adwords</strong></span> <span></span></p><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<li>Keyword\'s research adding new and removing low performing keywords</li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<li>Adding new Ad copies in the multiple Ad groups</li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<li>Changing Adwords strategy to increase the total number of clicks for. e.g; long tail keywords, short phrase keywords, exact match, broad match or broad match modifier.</li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<li>Daily monitoring the campaign and monthly progress report generation</li><br />\r\n<li>Always supporting the client to the best of our research and expertise level.</li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n<p><span></span> <span>Starting From 01-04-2019 to 01-05-2019</span></p>\";i:1;s:813:\"<p>Google Adwords Campaign Management <span><strong>Google Adwords</strong></span> <span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyword\'s research adding new and removing low performing keywords</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adding new Ad copies in the multiple Ad groups</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Changing <g class=\"gr_ gr_12 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar only-ins replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"12\" data-gr-id=\"12\">Adwords</g> strategy to increase the total number of clicks for. e.g; long tail keywords, short phrase keywords, exact match, broad match or broad match modifier.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Daily monitoring the campaign and monthly progress report generation</li>\r\n<li>Always supporting the client to the best of our research and expertise level.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\";}', '1', 'Khuram Iqbal', '2019-03-30 13:35:29'),
