(5979, 'invoice', 2699, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_long_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:756:\"<ul><br />\r\n<li>Graphically Rich web Design With Jquery Banners (English)</li><br />\r\n<li>Wordpress CMS.</li><br />\r\n<li>Beautifully Designed Menu along with Food Pictures. At the Later stage, it can be upgraded to an online Order System on Additional Charge.</li><br />\r\n<li>Integration with <strong>Google Places</strong> and <strong>Trip Advisor</strong> to show customer testimonials</li><br />\r\n<li>Video Enabled </li><br />\r\n<li>Specialized Media Pages with News Updating Facility</li><br />\r\n<li>Dynamic Picture Gallery </li><br />\r\n<li>Social Media Sharing (Facebook Share, Like, Twitter, etc)</li><br />\r\n<li>SEO Friendly</li><br />\r\n<li>Cross-Device Compatibility</li><br />\r\n<li>CMS support Adding New features fast and easy</li><br />\r\n</ul>\";i:1;s:37:\"<ul>\r\n<li>As Per Proposal</li>\r\n</ul>\";}', '1', 'Khuram Iqbal', '2019-10-05 13:42:55'),
