(6205, 'invoice', 2766, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_long_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:474:\"Key Features<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComplete SaaS solution with no servers to install<br />\r\nor maintain, ever.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSecures Windows (desktops and servers), Mac,<br />\r\niOS, and Android devices by infusing high-fidelity<br />\r\nmachine-learning into a blend of threat<br />\r\nprotection techniques<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnti-malware<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnti-Ransomware<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDevice Control<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFirewall<br />\r\n<br />\r\nApplication Control<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWeb Filtering\";i:1;s:351:\"<p>Key Features Complete SaaS solution with no servers to install or maintain, ever. Secures Windows (desktops and servers), Mac, iOS, and Android devices by infusing high-fidelity machine-learning into a blend of threat protection techniques Anti-malware Anti-Ransomware Device Control Firewall Application Control Web Filtering.</p>\r\n<p>users 15</p>\";}', '32', 'Akash Ahmed', '2019-10-30 17:20:50'),
