(6945, 'invoice', 2979, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_long_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:1221:\"Monthly Maintenance Service 1. <strong xss=\"removed\">Keep it running & Fresh              </strong><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<li>All feature of “keep it running” plan</li><br />\r\n<li>Cloud Backups storage upto 30 days</li><br />\r\n<li>Website Speed optimization one a year (Only Available for annual contract)</li><br />\r\n<li>Monthly 2 hours of Website update (Change of Banners, contents update, adding blog, Correction of websites bugs, if any)</li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n2.  <strong>LinkedIn Updates & Posting</strong><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<li>Weekly 2 posts</li><br />\r\n<li>Data will be taken from TakaSolutions.com </li><br />\r\n<li>Proper usage of Hashtags</li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n3. <strong>Quarterly Newsletter</strong><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<li>Data will be provided by TakaSolutions</li><br />\r\n<li>Designing and Sending of Newsletter</li><br />\r\n<li>Tracking all Stats and sending as Report</li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n4.<strong>  Reporting</strong><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n<li>Monthly Website Analytics Reports</li><br />\r\n<li>Monthly Updates Reports</li><br />\r\n<li>Quarterly suggestions to improve</li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n<strong>5. Youtube Channel Creation and Videos uploading </strong>3 Months Trial Contract\";i:1;s:1057:\"Monthly Maintenance Service 1.&nbsp;<strong xss=\"removed\">Keep it running & Fresh              </strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>All feature of “keep it running” plan</li>\r\n<li>Cloud Backups storage upto 30 days</li>\r\n<li>Website Speed optimization once a year (Only Available for annual contract)</li>\r\n<li>Monthly 2 hours of Website update (Change of Banners, contents update, adding blog, Correction of websites bugs, if any)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n2.  <strong>LinkedIn Updates & Posting</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Weekly 2 posts</li>\r\n<li>Data will be taken from TakaSolutions.com </li>\r\n<li>Proper usage of Hashtags</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n3. <strong>Quarterly Newsletter</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Data will be provided by TakaSolutions</li>\r\n<li>Designing and Sending of Newsletter</li>\r\n<li>Tracking all Stats and sending as Report</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n4.<strong>  Reporting</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Monthly Website Analytics Reports</li>\r\n<li>Monthly Updates Reports</li>\r\n<li>Quarterly suggestions to improve</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>5. Youtube Channel Creation and Videos uploading <br></strong>\";}', '1', 'Khuram Iqbal', '2020-03-09 10:22:14'),
