(7817, 'invoice', 3152, 'invoice_estimate_activity_updated_item_long_description', 'a:2:{i:0;s:788:\"<p class=\"usertext\">Client: Fitness Time<br>Type: Property Photoshoot<br>Dates: To Be Decided<br>Location: Almamzaar Dubai<br>Time: 15th August 2020 - Saturday<br><br>Photography Details<br>1. 2 Locations in Almazaar Beach – Dubai<br>2. Outside shots<br>3. Entrance<br>4. Lounge<br>5. Reception<br>6. Swimming pool and the healthy section<br>7. Cardio area<br>8. GX area<br>9. Strength area & Extreme area<br>10. FTZ Area<br>11. All Playgrounds including (football, basketball)<br>12. Some shots require our staff to be such as the entrance, cardio, strength and others<br>13. Models and people will be provided by the client<br><br>Post Production:<br>1. 30 retouched photos for ladies<br>2. 30 retouched photos for men<br>3. The whole library unretouched for both, male and female</p>\";i:1;s:692:\"<p class=\"usertext\">Client: Fitness TimeType: Property PhotoshootDates: To Be DecidedLocation: Almamzaar DubaiTime: 15th August 2020 - SaturdayPhotography Details1. 2 Locations in Almazaar Beach – Dubai2. Outside shots3. Entrance4. Lounge5. Reception6. Swimming pool and the healthy section7. Cardio area8. GX area9. Strength area & Extreme area10. FTZ Area11. All Playgrounds including (football, basketball)12. Some shots require our staff to be such as the entrance, cardio, strength and others13. Models and people will be provided by the clientPost Production:1. 30 retouched photos for ladies2. 30 retouched photos for men3. The whole library unretouched for both, male and female</p>\";}', '1', 'Khuram Iqbal', '2020-09-09 12:30:25'),
