(492, 'URGENT REQUEST: GDPR', '<div dir=\"auto\">Further to our meeting yesterday with Khurram, please find attached very urgent request for us to comply with the new GDPR policy. Lara had explained the importance of GDPR and its risk if we do not follow.<span>&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">As discussed with Khurram, we need to send this on Tuesday 22 May, so ideally we would like to get this done and tested by Sunday 20 May.<span>&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">I have attached all supporting documents you&rsquo;ll need for this request. For the Privacy Policy, we have created a CMS page which contains this info. Please embed this page on the Home Page, Khuram mentioned usually it is found at the bottom of the page. Also, please use this link on the GDPR notifications.<span>&nbsp;</span></div>', 2, '2018-05-19 08:21:25', '2018-05-19', NULL, NULL, 22, 0, 4, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 69, 'project', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0.00, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, '', '', 30, 'minute', '1', 0, '0', 'mannual'),
