(1377, 'updates contents', '<p>1 - In the SAHFC preferred time slots, please add the Ladies Time 9am to 3pm - as you did initially.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2 - Can you please link the Brick a Month form to the page of Brick a Month, with a button saying, \' Pledge Now \' and it goes to the form, please ensure to have a brick a month banner on that form.<br />And the name of the brick should be a drop-down, with the following text,&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Gold Brick</p>\r\n<p>Silver Brick&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Green Brick&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Blue Brick&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Red Brick&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>And the existing form should also have a brick a month banner and the existing button that says \' OWN A BRICK \' needs to be replaced by&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;\' BRICK A MONTH \'.</p>', 4, '2020-07-25 14:16:01', '2020-07-23', '2020-07-26', '2020-07-30 12:03:29', 24, 0, 5, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 91, 'project', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 30, 'minute', '1', 0, '0', 'mannual'),
