(1426, 'independence day', '<p>Your assistance is required with some updates to the website for Independence Day celebrations. Attached you will find four images:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1) Web banner</p>\r\n<p>2) Reflection of Pakistan</p>\r\n<p>3) Jashn-e-Pakistan</p>\r\n<p>4) Pakistan: A New Era</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Please add the web banner to the homepage and hyperlink it to a page with the three attached flyers. Under the \'<strong>Reflection of Pakistan\'</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>flyer, please add this text:<span>&nbsp;</span><em>Register here:&nbsp;</em><em><a href=\"https://forms.gle/FXDZFnjgpE6MjE7NA\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://forms.gle/FXDZFnjgpE6MjE7NA&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1597168601507000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFT6hHZ-6M0Ge_bud7SqAd9eHo_tA\">https://forms.gle/FXDZFnjgpE6MjE7NA</a></em></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><em>-<span>&nbsp;</span></em>Add this intro text at the very beginning of the page:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><em>PEHCHAN PAKISTAN</em></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><em>In honor of our 74th Independence Day, relish with us as we celebrate our freedom; our beloved motherland, Pakistan!</em></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- In addition, please add these following videos to the same page:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LGzkjvBNqQA\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DLGzkjvBNqQA&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1597168601507000&amp;usg=AFQjCNE2bYstWYsiagmgxFILRazIYShZHw\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LGzkjvBNqQA</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kvk5H898cco\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3Dkvk5H898cco&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1597168601507000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFhwCxfbOol9NEsQgOFp3lxw26-Rg\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kvk5H898cco</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SNcTbaPWjQw\" data-saferedirecturl