(1466, 'olivierdolz.fr', '<p>Hi Khuram</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>How are you?</p>\r\n<p>Could you please do few changes for me on the website &nbsp;<strong><a href=\"http://olivierdolz.fr/\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://OLIVIERDOLZ.FR&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1600163404482000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGCcF1400gvqeqQswyGpo7HqBelVw\">OLIVIERDOLZ.FR</a></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1/</p>\r\n<p>On the page&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.olivierdolz.fr/\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.olivierdolz.fr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1600163404482000&amp;usg=AFQjCNE9yPyPyboy9ijR0QATZx-zdLt3Bw\">https://www.olivierdolz.fr</a>, please change the french Number by this new number</p>\r\n<p>PARIS OFFICE &nbsp;<strong>+33(0)7 84 37 89 05</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2/</p>\r\n<p>At the bottom of<span>&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.olivierdolz.fr/\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.olivierdolz.fr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1600163404482000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHyxRoh20ayeLdCKJ9f8xlvHxvCKw\">www.olivierdolz.fr</a></p>\r\n<p>please change the french number as well by&nbsp;+33(0)7 84 37 89 05</p>\r\n<p>Please put first the FRENCH NUMBER and then the DUBAI number</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>3/</p>\r\n<p>At the bottom , you can see&nbsp;@2018 OLIVIER DOLZ WEDDING AGENCY PARIS</p>\r\n<p>please change the Date by 2020 instead of 2018 and Please add PARIS</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>4/</p>\r\n<p>On the page&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.olivierdolz.fr/contact/\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.olivierdolz.fr/contact/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1600163404482000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFLwExmYYrgDjcKD-6-bM_D_59DKw\">https://www.olivierdolz.fr/contact/</a></p>\r\n<p>Please send the form message to<span>&nbsp;</span><a href=\"mailto:olivier@olivierdolz.com\">olivier@olivierdolz.com</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>5/</p>\r\n<p>On the page&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.olivierdolz.fr/contact/\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.olivierdolz.fr/contact/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1600163404482000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFLwExmYYrgDjcKD-6-bM_D_59DKw\">https://www.olivierdolz.fr/contact/</a></p>\r\n<p>Please change the address&nbsp;of France by</p>\r\n<p>Avenue des Champs Elys&eacute;es&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>75008 PARIS</p>\r\n<p>FRANCE</p>\r\n<p>and phone number by&nbsp;+33(0)7 84 37 89 05</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>6/</p>\r\n<p>On the full website, please change the facebook link with this page&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Olivier-Dolz-Wedding-Planner-Agency-Paris-531514664030707/?view_public_for=531514664030707\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.facebook.com/Olivier-Dolz-Wedding-Planner-Agency-Paris-531514664030707/?view_public_for%3D531514664030707&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1600163404482000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHdLDqLLv7-5oDhnEb31HiFPG5AEA\">https://www.facebook.com/Olivier-Dolz-Wedding-Planner-Agency-Paris-531514664030707/?view_public_for=531514664030707</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>7/</p>\r\n<p>Please change the link for instagram by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/olivierdolzparis/\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.instagram.com/olivierdolzparis/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1600163404482000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFnSCDDMQ0E7x7OcdlpqfVgzvrq6A\">https://www.instagram.com/olivierdolzparis/</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>8/</p>\r\n<p>On the page&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.olivierdolz.fr/the_agency/\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.olivierdolz.fr/the_agency/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1600163404482000&amp;usg=AFQjCNG3mDxWcEjxhJK-dqyluEelURnVgQ\">https://www.olivierdolz.fr/the_agency/</a></p>\r\n<p>Please remove the Picture square where it is in black and you see contact with 2 phone number</p>\r\n<p>please remove this picture</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>thank you</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Olivier</p>', 4, '2020-09-14 21:55:36', '2020-09-14', '2020-09