(102, 65, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2018-09-18 09:48:05', '<g class=\"gr_ gr_64 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"64\" data-gr-id=\"64\">As</g> We have already informed Lindsay on email, this has been done and approved. so the ticket is closed for now', NULL, 22, NULL),
(103, 64, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2018-09-18 09:50:29', '<strong>Wisdom Team:</strong> Discussion has been done with <g class=\"gr_ gr_30 gr-alert gr_spell gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim ContextualSpelling ins-del multiReplace\" id=\"30\" data-gr-id=\"30\">Paytabs</g>. The reason is found. We will complete the necessary changes by tomorrow. And it will be available onwards for testing. &ndash;<br />\r\n<p class=\"x_1621807552MsoListParagraph\"><strong>Lindsay:</strong> Spoke with Faisal regarding this, he said the issue was now resolved. We will contact him directly if there are any further issues.</p>\r\n<p class=\"x_1621807552MsoListParagraph\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"x_1621807552MsoListParagraph\">This was email conversation with Lindsay and Mr. Khuram. So the issue has been addressed and <g class=\"gr_ gr_192 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_run_anim Grammar only-ins doubleReplace replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"192\" data-gr-id=\"192\">ticket</g> is closed for now</p>', NULL, 22, NULL),
(104, 63, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2018-09-18 09:53:55', 'Wisdom Team: Work on is started on it. We will complete will confirm you to test by Sunday.<br />\r\n<p class=\"x_1621807552MsoListParagraph\">Lindsay: Still unable to send invoices from the admin page using a mobile device<br /><br /><br />This has been tested by wisdom team, and it seems to be working, but for BBG team they are having issues so, we have requested them to share screenshots with us. Also, Wisdom Team is verifying it on their end and looking if there any issue with backend responsiveness.&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 22, NULL),
(105, 75, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2018-09-19 10:25:15', 'I spoke with Lindsay on phone and she told that they just want to add a column on the current export report of members, showing comma separated categories in that column. So, It is support ticket', NULL, 22, NULL),
(106, 77, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2018-09-20 16:34:19', '<p>Scope of this ticket would be:</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>1- auto generate a tax invoice from proforma Invoice on Payment<br />2- auto send to the client on successful payment<br />3- admin can see the list of tax invoices<br />4- admin will be able to re-send tax invoice<br />5- admin can export all invoices in excel format<br />6- search filters: admin can search by (invoice #, date, user, proforma invoice#, payment ref# )<br />7- download invoice as pdf<br />8- maintain a check if the receipt has been sent to the member on payment<br />9- save receipts to maintain a record<br />10- admin can resend receipt generated<br />11- view / download receipt as pdf&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>this scope is already approved by accounts on email.</p>', NULL, 22, NULL),
(107, 79, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2018-09-24 17:22:01', 'Done.', NULL, 22, NULL),
