(109, 80, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2018-09-30 22:15:03', 'API Link:<br />http://booking.thecaptainsclub.ae/api/v1/stats/availabity<br /><br />by default the format is xml, and stats will be shown for today\'s date.<br /><br />To get response in json, u can access the api like:<br />http://booking.thecaptainsclub.ae/api/v1/stats/availabity?_format=json<br /><br /><a href=\"http://booking.thecaptainsclub.ae/api/v1/stats/availabity?_format=json\"></a>To get stats for a particular date, you can send the date like:<br />http://booking.thecaptainsclub.ae/api/v1/stats/availabity?date=2018-10-05&amp;_format=json<br /><br /><br />5 Hrs', NULL, 33, NULL),
