(15, 0, 1182, 486, NULL, NULL, 1, 2, 5, 1, '4d804894d9d4053ed84939a2cd359c47', 'Back-end: Fees on Event registration', 'Again, the system is not following the fee we enter manually on the \"Fee paid\" field when registering from the back-end. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso, instead of displaying the fee as negative ie \"-147\", please display \"0\".  See screenshot.', NULL, '2018-05-15 09:10:56', 69, '2018-07-05 12:35:33', 1, 1, '86.98.48.183', 0),
