(22, 0, 1182, 486, NULL, NULL, 1, 3, 5, 1, '35cd79ec262a579238312c72b9f21492', 'Members due for renewal: Invoiced Status', 'When a member gets invoiced for their renewal, the system automatically deactivates their membership. Please note that renewal invoices are raised 2 months prior to their membership expiry. Technically they are still members, so their membership should still be active and they should be able to log in and register for events at member rate.', NULL, '2018-06-04 13:27:50', 69, '2018-06-05 09:54:44', 1, 1, '86.98.55.201', 0),
