(37, 0, 1016, 496, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 5, 0, '6b2a6765bc9bdfef01fb3329e0b27c9d', 'Membership expiry Email', 'Comments from Zaid:<br />\r\nDear Iqbal <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease ask naeem to be modify the message below, and please make the sender caren@thecaptainsclub.ae and to use the signature below<br />\r\n<br />\r\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDear Captain zaidtestmember,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKindly note that your membership renewal date is on the 11th of July 2018. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease don’t hesitate to contact me to start the renewal process. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBest Regards<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCaroline Tayao │  Account Manager<br />\r\n<br />\r\nM:   +971 52 641 4172<br />\r\n<br />\r\nE:    Caren@thecaptainsclub.ae<br />\r\n<br />\r\nW:   www.thecaptainsclub.ae', NULL, '2018-06-29 23:15:34', 75, '2018-07-14 13:34:23', 1, 1, '5.30.119.26', 0),
(38, 0, 1016, 496, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 5, 0, '5e8df8a8a52f4253b07c19243176fd9d', 'Phase 2 - Item 5: Email and mobile nos confirmation', 'Comments from Zaid:<br />\r\nI need the current members to confirm or renter their email and mobile nos. <br />\r\nAll new members once we sent the log in and after entering their new password to reenter email address and mobile number.', NULL, '2018-06-29 23:17:48', 75, '2018-07-08 01:55:47', 1, 1, '5.30.119.26', 0),
(39, 0, 1016, 496, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 5, 0, 'ca0afbaf29a1fd8079b1d27b0c19a9e1', 'Newsletter', 'Comments from Zaid:<br />\r\nWhen we go to the members panel we can send emails by clicking on the email button. However we can’t choose a sender, or cc any employee. For example I want to send an email to all active members from md@thecatainsclub and cc icare this is not possible. Of course all members are BCCd and you already done that where members can’t view each other but as employees we can’t choose sender nor cc others.', NULL, '2018-06-30 01:57:19', 75, '2018-07-03 15:05:05', 1, 1, '5.30.119.26', 0),
(40, 0, 1016, 496, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 5, 0, '05d7710ca648d60d091f477d2fe96065', 'Phase 2 - Item 9/10: Night drive training request', 'Comments from Zaid:<br />\r\nIf a member books a night drive with out permission from the admin side the following message to show: <br />\r\n<br />\r\n1 hour orientation required prior to boating at night for your safety and as per the terms and conditions. Please click on the button Below to proceed. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n“ Dear Captain, please add any addition remarks or you can just click submit” <br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo date required it will just open a box if he wants to add any remarks or click submit, we will receive it as a request category night drive just add sajjad@thecaptainsclub.ae to the mailing list for this request,  <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnce the request is submitted the member will receive an email that his request is submitted similar to the request template available now.', NULL, '2018-07-03 10:33:10', 75, '2018-10-04 18:39:57', 1, 1, '80.227.108.78', 0),
(41, 0, 1016, 496, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 3, 0, '8fb9bd36daa5a0e0ac7e5792f3085c1c', 'Phase 2 - Item 11: Boat information', 'Comments from Zaid:<br />\r\nWhen the member goes to make a booking (I) button to be available to next to every boat that will display a table, we will sent you the criteria of the table soon and we can modify from the boat section. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe same table will be displayed once he receives booking confirmation and booking reminder.', NULL, '2018-07-03 10:35:17', 75, '2019-01-23 23:52:35', 1, 1, '80.227.108.78', 0),
(42, 0, 1016, 496, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 3, 2, '0c17987990d52ef8d397ff8304ae18a3', 'Phase 2 - Item 14: late booking for next day in the morning. Please call me before starting', 'Comments from Zaid:<br />\r\nIf a member opens the system after 8:00 Pm and wants to book for tomorrow morning session ( 7:00 AM-12:30pm) and none of the sessions are booked, the following  message in green to be displayed:<br />\r\nBulk booking and admin bookings  are not considered as booking, similar to the night drive rules,   <br />\r\n <br />\r\nDear Captain <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a very short notice booking, please book the afternoon session or try another day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSorry for the inconvenience<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBest Regards', NULL, '2018-07-03 10:36:27', 75, '2018-11-20 00:02:24', 1, 1, '80.227.108.78', 0),
(43, 0, 1016, 496, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 5, 2, 'a022dfc710e6bb4e172057a41b62abbb', 'Phase 2 - Item 15: night cruise from yas marina.', 'Comments from Zaid:<br />\r\nPlease show instead of book temporary not available, Learn more. If member click on learn more the following message displayed in green to be shown<br />\r\n <br />\r\nDear Captain <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe apologies for the absence of the night cruise service from Yas Marina temporary, please feel free to book a Night Drive from Yas Marina or a Night Cruise from Emirates Palace.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSorry for the inconvenience <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBest Regards', NULL, '2018-07-03 10:37:12', 75, '2018-10-04 18:28:09', 1, 1, '80.227.108.78', 0),
(44, 0, 1016, 496, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 5, 2, 'df6b3b66dc11a6fe26104a74dcc1dec7', 'Phase 2 - Item 16: night cruise from DMYC.', 'Comments from Zaid:<br />\r\nPlease show instead of book temporary not available, Learn more. If member click on learn more the following message displayed in green to be shown<br />\r\n <br />\r\nDear Captain <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe apologies for the absence of the night cruise service from DMYC temporary, please feel free to book a Night Drive. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSorry for the inconvenience <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBest Regards', NULL, '2018-07-03 10:37:55', 75, '2018-10-04 18:28:44', 1, 1, '80.227.108.78', 0),
(46, 0, 1016, 496, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 1, 0, '2ebc67ac9fd3cafed828fbe08d3fde5f', 'Phase 2 - Item 3B: Booking Status', 'Comments from Zaid:<br />\r\nYesterday   Date     Month   From to <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll    AD   DXB, ( for ad or dxb it can show all or a certain marina if we choose) <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf any of the below clicked it would show the details. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nKindly note that the below booking status data can be obtain either from the system operation panel swapping replacing request panels,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease advice a method to get the maximum accurate data.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTotal # bookings <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBooking Status <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTrip Status <br />\r\n<br />\r\nbehavior<br />\r\n<br />\r\nsmooth <br />\r\n<br />\r\nlate arrivals<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSmooth<br />\r\n<br />\r\ntechnical<br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nOrignal NA<br />\r\n<br />\r\nstuck<br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRequest<br />\r\n<br />\r\nno show<br />\r\n<br />\r\n                    Admin<br />\r\n<br />\r\n                    Canceled Weather<br />\r\n <br />\r\n                      Canceled Orginal NA<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn addition kindly note that this data is required to be viewed in the members panel when we click on the button “ Bookings” to have a summary showing all bookings for example a member called JACK has a total of 50 bookings <br />\r\n<br />\r\nStatus                      trip status                             behaviors <br />\r\n<br />\r\n30 smooth                10 smooth                         7 late arrivals                           <br />\r\n<br />\r\n20 request                 1 technical<br />\r\n<br />\r\n10 orginal NA            7 stuck<br />\r\n<br />\r\n                                    3 admin<br />\r\n<br />\r\n                                    9 no show<br />\r\n<br />\r\n                                    10 canceled weather <br />\r\n<br />\r\n                                   10 canceled orignal NA', NULL, '2018-07-03 11:49:40', 75, '2018-07-05 17:35:05', 1, 1, '80.227.108.78', 0),
(47, 0, 1016, 496, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 5, 0, '5b91f954411e1ba1319c073d218550ba', 'Phase 2 - Item 3c: members summary', '<span>Comments from Zaid:<br />Always to show to be expired in the current month and 7 months ahead. Kindly note that once the member renews while he is active please consider the new expiry date the the current contract&nbsp;</span><br /><br /><span>Package Active (exp june) (July) (Aug) (Sept) Oct) Nov) Dec) (Jan) (Total Expired) (Canceled) (Hold)&nbsp;</span><br /><br /><span>GoldN</span><br /><br /><span>Smart</span><br /><br /><span>Silver</span><br /><br /><span>Etc&hellip;</span><br /><br /><br /> Add Groups options so packages can be assigned for dashboard, and display total under each group<br /> Add enable/disable option for packages.', NULL, '2018-07-03 15:00:00', 75, '2018-10-04 18:34:13', 1, 1, '94.200.112.14', 0),
(48, 0, 1016, 496, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 5, 0, '5f4f238f9857f43cbf489fc554682a91', 'Package Grouping(Duplicate)', 'Always to show to be expired in the current month and 7 months ahead. Kindly  note that once the member renews while he is active please consider the new expiry date the the current contract                   <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPackage    Active   (exp june) (July) (Aug) (Sept) Oct) Nov) Dec) (Jan)    (Total Expired) (Canceled) (Hold) <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGoldN<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSmart<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSilver<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEtc…', NULL, '2018-07-03 15:29:17', 75, '2018-07-03 15:31:34', 1, 1, '94.200.112.14', 0),
